This repository bundles, unmodified, the Energy ADE 3.0 (beta 8) schema set in
Energy_ADE-3.0beta8/, which is licensed separately under the Apache License 2.0.
See Energy_ADE-3.0beta8/LICENSE and Energy_ADE-3.0beta8/PROVENANCE.md for the
terms and the source. The two KIT viewer upgrade files under
KITModelViewer_V7.5.2_Build-3777/ are derived schema artifacts; the viewer
itself is not part of this repository (see README section 6).
